# [IMPL-SORT_THREE_INTEGERS] [ARCH-SORT_THREE_INTEGERS] [REQ-SORT_THREE_INTEGERS]
# How: Single Active procedure; pure ascending sort of three integers via Array#sort.

procedure SORT_THREE_INTEGERS(a, b, c):
  Contract:
    INPUT: a, b, c — Integer
    OUTPUT: sorted — Array of 3 Integer, ascending
    PRE: a, b, c are Integer
    POST: sorted == [a, b, c].sort AND sorted.length == 3
    EFFECTS: pure
  sorted := [a, b, c].sort
  RETURN sorted
